穿云 core muse.21: 测速 on congested home lines (China Mobile home broadband).
Many working nodes showed 超时. A thorough test opened a warm-up probe and then 5 probes at
once per node with 16 workers (up to ~80 new connections at the same moment); lines with
per-user session limits / QoS dropped part of them, and the 5 s default timeout left no room
for one lost packet on a slow route. Now: 8 workers by default, 3 concurrent samples, 8 s
default probe timeout (the app sends its own values), and a node without a good value that
fails is reported as 0 ("still testing") and re-tested once 3 s later (one probe, full
timeout, queued behind the running test) before it is reported timed out.

